| 5.16 Persistence, ledgers and receipts | `Locked` | `thin_seam` | `src/nvda_desk/persistence` and `src/nvda_desk/repositories` | Repository/store seams and bounded SQL persistence exist, but most material state remains process memory and must not be called durable or replay-complete. |
