**13. Physical conflict findings relevant to the first wave**  
  
The principal source boundaries for M01, M04, M07 and M08 can be assigned with disjoint exact file write sets. Directory-level configuration and aggregation surfaces are still shared and must remain locked. Structural test-import analysis also identifies shared physical proof surfaces, including:  
  
