	●	tests/tier_a/normative_authority/test_gate_c_ingress_identity_and_dmp.py  
  
Those files may carry propositions relevant to more than one root module. They may be observed by several lanes but must have one mutating owner at a time. Module-local expected-red proof should be placed in dedicated module proof files where lawful, rather than turning shared historical files into merge-conflict magnets.  
  
Likewise, workers must not concurrently edit shared aggregation and composition surfaces such as:  
  
